# Findings that were reviewed and accepted on purpose (see issue #27).
# Every entry needs a reason.

# DS-0002: no USER instruction in the root Dockerfile.
# Intentional: docker/entrypoint.sh only fixes the ownership of the mounted volumes and then
# starts the app via `setpriv --no-new-privs` as PUID:PGID. PUID=0 is rejected. Started with
# `--user`, the container runs without root from the start.
DS-0002
